ting the _assetId, _phase and _allocPoint of the rewardPool Requirements: - a corresponding asset pool in SMASP should exist for provided `_assetId` - `_phase` must either be 1 or 2 - The rewardPool's initial phase must be 1 less than `_phase`","_assetId":": assetId of the reward pool","_phase":": _phase to be initialized"}},"claimRewardsFromPool(uint256)":{"details":"See {IPrivacyMining-claimRewardsFromPool} -> lets a user claim rewards if it has been accumulated","params":{"_assetId":": Assset id of asset reward pool Note: Doesn't pay out the reward if user has accumulated zero reward in the given pool Emits a {LogRewardPaidByPool} event indicating the paid reward Updates the reward parameters of the reward pool Requirements: - user's phase in the reward pool should match reward pool's current phase"}},"constructor":{"details":"Sets the values for {SILENT} token and {SMASP} contract Both of these values are immutable: they can only be set once during construction Requirements: `_silentToken` and `_smaspContract` cannot be the zero address"},"depositAssetToPool(address,uint256,uint256)":{"details":"See {IPrivacyMining-depositAssetToPool}","params":{"_amount":": Deposit amount of user in SMASP to be registered for the pool Updates the pool balance of the pool and user based on `_amount` Emits a {LogDepositToPool} event Requirements: - can only be called by SMASP contract - rewardPool for `_assetId` must be in phase I - reward period for phase I must not have completed already","_assetId":": Assset id of asset reward pool in SMASP","_user":": Assset id of asset reward pool in SMASP"}},"getPendingRewards(uint256,address)":{"details":"Fetches the pending rewards of a user w.r.t. a reward pool","params":{"_assetId":": Asset id of asset reward pool in SMASP","_user":": Address of an user"}},"getPhaseInfo(uint256)":{"details":"Fetches the state of a phase in PMC","params":{"_phase":": Phase number(1 or 2) in PMC"}},"getRewardPoolInfo(uint256)":{"details":"Fetches the information of an asset reward pool in PMC","params":{"_assetId":": Asset id of asset reward pool in SMASP"}},"getRewardPoolPhase(uint256)":{"details":"Fetches the current phase of a reward pool in PMC","params":{"_assetId":": Asset id of asset reward pool in SMASP"}},"getUserPoolInfo(address,uint256)":{"details":"Fetches the information of a user w.r.t. a reward pool in PMC","params":{"_assetId":": Asset id of asset reward pool in SMASP","_user":": Address of an user"}},"lastRewardApplicableTime(uint40)":{"details":"Computes the last reward claimable time for a reward pool","params":{"_rewardEndTime":": RewardPool.rewardEndTime of the reward Pool"}},"massUpdatePoolRewardVariables(uint256[])":{"details":"Updates all the reward variables of reward pools in a given phase","params":{"_assetIds":": Array of assetId of all reward pools currently in `_phase` Called whenever a new reward pool is added to the PMC {Func: addRewardPool} OR the allocPoint for an existing reward pool is updated {Func: updateRewardPoolAllocations} This is because the rewards for all pools is affected by the above two actions"}},"owner()":{"details":"Returns the address of the current owner."},"paused()":{"details":"Returns true if the contract is paused, and false otherwise."},"renounceOwnership()":{"details":"Leaves the contract without owner. It will not be possible to call `onlyOwner` functions anymore. Can only be called by the current owner. NOTE: Renouncing ownership will leave the contract without an owner, thereby removing any functionality that is only available to the owner."},"setRewardEmissionRate(uint256,uint128)":{"details":"Lets the owner update the emissionRate for a phase in PMC","params":{"_phase":": one of the two global phases of reward pools in PMC","_rewardEmissionRate":": amount of vouchers (`_phase` == 1) or silent rewards (`_phase` == 2) to be distributed per second in PMC Emits the event {LogUpdateRewardEmissionRate} denoting the newly updated reward emission rate for the `_phase` NOTE: Owner whould update all the reward pools with the function: {massupdatePoolRewardVariables} before calling this function"}},"stakeSilentToPool(uint256,uint256)":{"details":"See {IPrivacyMining-stakeSilentToPool}","params":{"_amount":": Amount of Silent tokens to be staked Lets user stake their Silent tokens to a reward pool - _amount cannot be zero - reward pool must be in phase 2 - the current reward period shouldn't have completed - the contract must be in unpaused state - the user must have participated in phase 1 of the reward pool:   UserPoolState.phase should not be zero - the user must have collected voucher rewards in phase 1 Updates the balance of user and the pool based on `_amount` Emits a {LogSilentStakedToPool} event indicating the staked amount","_assetId":": Assset id of asset reward pool"}},"transferOwnership(address)":{"details":"Transfers ownership of the contract to a new account (`newOwner`). Can only be called by the current owner."},"unstakeSilentFromPool(uint256,uint256)":{"details":"See {IPrivacyMining-unstakeSilentFromPool}","params":{"_amount":": Amount of Silent tokens to be unstaked Lets user(caller) unstake their Silent tokens from a reward pool Requirements - reward pool must be in phase 2 - `_amount` cannot be less than user's total stake in the pool - user must be in phase 2 for the given reward pool Updates the balance of user and the pool based on `_amount` powered by user's total voucher balance Transfers `_amount` Silent tokens from contract to the user Emits a {LogSilentUnstakedFromPool} event indicating the updated balance","_assetId":": Assset id of asset reward pool"}},"updatePoolRewardVariables(uint256)":{"details":"Updates the reward variables of a reward pool","params":{"_assetId":": assetId of the reward pool"}},"updateRewardPoolAllocations(uint256,uint256,uint8)":{"details":"Lets the owner update the allocation points for a reward pool","params":{"_assetId":": assetId of the reward pool","_newAllocPoint":": 